sequenceDiagram
  actor B as Pembeli
  actor S as Penjual
  participant FE as React
  participant API as Express
  participant DB as MySQL

  B->>FE: klik Sewa
  FE->>API: POST /api/mp/jasa/:id/sewa
  API->>DB: INSERT orders PENDING
  API-->>FE: order id
  FE-->>S: notifikasi permintaan

  S->>FE: terima atau tolak
  alt tolak
    FE->>API: tolak
    API->>DB: REJECTED
  else terima
    FE->>API: terima
    API->>DB: ACCEPTED
    FE-->>B: siap dibayar
  end
